&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(注)１．&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;株式分割（１：100）によるものであります。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　２．株式会社アイビスモバイルを吸収合併(合併比率１:117)したことによるものであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;３．有償一般募集（ブックビルディング方式による募集）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　発行価格　　　　　　 730円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　引受価額　　　　　671.60円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　資本組入額　　　　335.80円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　払込金額総額　 470,120千円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;４．第三者割当増資（オーバーアロットメントによる売出しに関連した第三者割当増資）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　割当価格　　　　　671.60円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　資本組入額　　　　335.80円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　割当先　　東海東京証券(株)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:47.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;５．新株予約権の行使による増加であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ChangesInNumberOfIssuedSharesStatedCapitalEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ShareholdingByShareholderCategoryTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
